<https://litlfred.github.io/folio/references/who-pub-tps-931.page-058.3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "WHO Editorial Style Monval Nucleosides The symbols used for ribonucleoside residues (radicals) are: A. adenosine C cytidine G_ guanosine T ribosylthymine I inosine U_ uridine X xanthosine wy 5-ribosyluracil (pseudouridine). The prefix “t” (for ribo) may be used for emphasis or clarity." <https://iris.who.int/graph/metadata> .
